{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04277","headline":"早秋出塞寄东台详正学士 · 骆宾王","name":"早秋出塞寄东台详正学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促驾踰三水，长驱望五原。\n天阶分斗极，地理接楼烦。\n溪月明关陇，戎云聚塞垣。\n山川殊物候，风壤异凉喧。\n戍古秋尘合，沙寒宿雾繁。\n昔余迷学步，投迹忝词源。\n兰渚浮延阁，蓬山款禁园。\n彯缨陪绂冕，载笔偶璵璠。\n汲冢宁详蠹，秦牢讵辨冤。\n一朝从篚服，千里骛轻轩。\n乡梦随魂断，边声入听喧。\n南图终铩翮，北上遽催辕。\n吊影慙连茹，浮生倦触藩。\n数奇何以托，桃李自无言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}